Package: cc-switch-web
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: CC Switch
Depends: libc6, libssl1.1 | libssl3, libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.0-37
Description: CC Switch — AI CLI Tools Configuration Manager
 A comprehensive management tool for AI CLI tools configuration,
 supporting Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, OpenCode, OpenClaw and Hermes.
 .
 This package provides the native desktop window (cc-switch) and
 the embedded web server (cc-switch-web). No browser needed.
 .
 Features:
   * Provider management (CRUD, switching, 50+ presets)
   * MCP server management across 5+ AI tools
   * Prompts/Skills editor with cross-app sync
   * Local HTTP proxy with automatic failover
   * Session history browser for all supported tools
   * Usage tracking and cost analytics
   * WebDAV cloud sync
 .
 The application opens as a standalone window. Close the window
 to automatically stop all background services.
